Package: planetary-cspice
Architecture: any
Section: libs
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: NAIF CSPICE toolkit built as a shared library
 The NASA NAIF CSPICE toolkit (N0067) compiled as a position-independent
 shared object (libcspice.so) plus its C headers, installed under /usr/local.
 Used by grass-planetary-addons and other planetary GIS tools for real-ephemeris
 sub-solar and sub-observer computations through a thin ctypes wrapper.
 .
 CSPICE is produced by NASA/JPL NAIF and distributed under the NAIF license.
 This package only repackages the upstream sources as a shared library.

Package: grass-planetary-addons
