Description: GRASS GIS addons for planetary science and landing site analysis
 Planetary bridge: complete suite of GRASS addon modules for planetary
 image processing, photometric correction, spectral analysis, geometric
 operations, and landing site evaluation on planetary science data.
 .
 Includes 55 modules across 11 categories:
  - I/O: PDS3/PDS4/ISIS3 import-export, DEM and ancillary data import,
    SPICE kernel management
  - Photometric: photocube, normalization, atmospheric correction
  - Geometry: sensor-to-map reprojection, slope/shadow, DEM processing
  - Spectral: mineral indices, continuum removal, band operations
  - Rings: ring-plane projection, radial brightness statistics
  - Cratering: rim auto-delineation (p.crater.draw), size-frequency
    dating, impact-scaling on vector rims with a built-in 48-body
    planetary database
  - Terrain hazard: multi-scale slope, roughness, composite hazard maps,
    and moving landing-ellipse footprint scanner
  - Illumination: time-averaged solar illumination (p.illumination.sunfraction),
    per-step shadow casting with OpenMP + optional OpenCL (p.sunmask),
    and horizon elevation raster (p.horizon.gpu)
  - Visibility: Earth-contact fraction, LOS horizon map, relay-orbiter
    contact fraction
  - Decision support: AHP weight elicitation, WLC/TOPSIS scoring,
    top-candidate ranking with Monte Carlo sensitivity
  - Pipeline: end-to-end orchestrator (p.landing), wxPython GUI wizard
    (g.gui.landing), Qt6 wizard (p-landing-qt)
 .
 Body descriptors (Moon, Mars, Venus) and mission JSON files are
 installed alongside the modules for use with the landing pipeline.
 .
 All modules are released into the public domain under the Unlicense.
 .
 Supports 7 fundamental C libraries plus 2 shared Python libraries:
  - p_pds: PDS3/PDS4 label parsing and image I/O
  - p_photomodel: 7 photometric models (Hapke, Minnaert, etc.)
  - p_atmosmodel: 4 atmospheric radiative transfer models
  - p_shapemodel: Ellipsoid, DEM, and plane ray-surface intersections
  - p_projection_planet: Ring and high-latitude map projections
  - p_spectra: Band depth, continuum removal, SAM analysis
  - p_spice: NAIF CSPICE geometry toolkit wrapper
  - p_lib.py: Landing-pipeline core utilities (DEM, illumination, AHP)
  - p_spice.py: SPICE kernel management and subpoint calculations
